  "limitations": [
    "Native AutoCAD execution remains unavailable and unqualified.",
    "CELLSTYLEMAP is source-bound immutable packet access; role meanings, format evaluation and editable table backing remain separate.",
    "SECTION_MANAGER membership editing requires a qualified loaded manager; public creation and explicit erasure remain separate.",
    "PolygonMesh retention covers ordinary unsmoothed sequences only; fitted grids, POLYFACE records and general topology operations remain separate.",
    "HATCH conics preserve exact curve classes under the documented numeric contract; unrepresentable tiny bulges reject atomically. Non-similarity pattern/gradient transforms remain separate.",
    "Version diagnostics report documented writer rejections and omissions. They do not establish complete compatibility, perform conversion, or enable earlier typed dialects.",
    "Mixed graph links are explicitly authored and their retained source packet provenance is documented."
  ],
